Started to wonder what I wrote and had to check if NH really behaves 
like this.

In wiz-mode I wished for uncursed ring of fire and cold resistance, 
blessed fixed water walking boots, uncursed wand of cold and uncursed 
long sword.

Put on both rings and boots. Wished for a pool of lava and dropped the 
long sword. Stepped back and zapped the wand of cold to cool down the lava.

Didn't need to wish for a pick-axe as my character was an archeologist, 
so I just stepped back to the spot where the lava has been and dug down.

The long sword was not harmed at all. I would imagine that a long sword 
would melt to a piece of junk if it was dropped in lava.

